  "fields": {
    "summary": "chore(factory): pin dmtools-agents @cad2805 — mutexExcludeSelf + conflict-rework + release-bump authorship",
    "description": "Cumulative factory pin bump (owner standard, after #1095):

- **#577/#578** — mutexExcludeSelf: a self-holding candidate counts as holder (mutex serialisation no longer freezes on its own PRs; the double-arm freeze of 12:05Z was the OLD pin lacking this)
- **#579** — conflict_rework: PR-anchored dispatch when no OPEN linked issue (DIRTY machine PRs no longer dead-letter)
- **#580** — pack release: create dist/ before the .no-release marker write
- **#581** — release-bump PRs (chore/release-v* / chore(release):) from the repo owner count as machine-authored — closes the manual-review-leg dead-zone on auto-release PRs

Pack: agents-rel-20260930-115058 (Latest) from logic SHA 52934dff.
Pin flipped in lockstep: machine-sm.yml, ai-teammate.yml, machine-merge.yml. factory_stub_ref_test.dart green."
  }
}

